---
// Hero — homepage hero section
---
<section class="hero-section">
  <div class="hero-container">
    <div class="hero-badge">
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path>
        <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline>
      </svg>
      Precios actualizados Bilbao 2026
    </div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">Calculadora de Reformas en Bilbao</h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">Calcula tu presupuesto de reforma en Bilbao en menos de 2 minutos. Integral desde 700€/m², baño desde 2.500€, cocina desde 5.000€. Sin registro, con precios reales de 2026.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta-group">
      <a href="/calculadora/index.html" class="hero-cta-primary">
        <svg alt="" class="hero-cta-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
          <line x1="8" y1="6" x2="16" y2="6"></line>
          <line x1="8" y1="10" x2="16" y2="10"></line>
          <line x1="8" y1="14" x2="12" y2="14"></line>
        </svg>
        Calcular presupuesto gratis
      </a>
      <a href="/empresas/index.html" class="hero-cta-secondary">
        Ver empresas de reformas
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-trust">
      <span class="hero-trust-item">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
        Gratuito
      </span>
      <span class="hero-trust-item">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
        Sin registro
      </span>
      <span class="hero-trust-item">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
        En menos de 2 min
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FDF6F0 0%, #FEF9F4 50%, #FFF8F2 100%);
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem 5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .hero-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background: rgba(196, 92, 62, 0.1);
    color: var(--color-terracota);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.375rem 0.875rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(196, 92, 62, 0.2);
  }
  .hero-title {
    font-family: var(--font-playfair);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-grafito);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: var(--color-gris);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
  }
  .hero-cta-group {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .hero-cta-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--color-terracota);
    color: white;
    padding: 0.875rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(196, 92, 62, 0.35);
    transition: background 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }
  .hero-cta-primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-terracota-hover);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(196, 92, 62, 0.4);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: white;
  }
  .hero-cta-icon { width: 18px; height: 18px; }
  .hero-cta-secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.875rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-terracota);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-terracota);
    transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }
  .hero-cta-secondary:hover {
    background: var(--color-terracota);
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .hero-trust {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .hero-trust-item {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.375rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-gris);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .hero-trust-item svg { color: #22c55e; }
</style>
